{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "method": "Sobol-ALE-informed constrained qLogNEHVI for RAPEC-v8",
  "selection_basis": "The focused RAPEC-v8 Sobol-ALE analysis achieved reliable surrogate fidelity for energy saving, quality regret, stop epoch, and joint success. It identified these four parameters as the practical control levers; trend_window remains fixed because its overall total-order effects were small.",
